      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a warm, clear Norwegian teacher speaking natural Norwegian Bokmål with an Eastern Norwegian accent; calm and unhurried, never theatrical #ctx:1emexh9'
    'male|a||Og snittet var aldri faren: utdanning er svært skjevt fordelt, så doktorgradscellene i én by har to eller tre personer.':
