      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a warm, clear Norwegian teacher speaking natural Norwegian Bokmål with an Eastern Norwegian accent; calm and unhurried, never theatrical #ctx:130bs43'
    male|a||Det finnes bare tre spaker, og det samme skriptet kan trekke i alle tre.:
