      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a warm, clear Norwegian teacher speaking natural Norwegian Bokmål with an Eastern Norwegian accent; calm and unhurried, never theatrical #ctx:hrqd6s'
    'male|a||Spak to: fem kull i stedet for ett, 1983 til 1987 – et kvart million mennesker der det var femti tusen.':
